ry_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"g7uv5VJ645cCh0ofch6KTQ","review_id":"Yi-NhHeI09_c96gLz_spgg","date":"2018-06-24T11:19:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.940788984298706,"text_excerpt":"What a nice place for lunch! I had to wait in line for a few minutes, but it wasn't too bad of a wait. I had the grilled shrimp po boy. The grilled shrimp was well seasoned and yummy. I sort of wish I'd gotten the grilled fish entree and skipped that bread, since I also got an order of garlic bread (so good!). But I really enjoyed it all, and appreciated the close proximity to the convention center."},{"business_id":"g7uv5VJ645cCh0ofch6KTQ","review_id":"48awAig_j-oUYmU_Gbl1Og","date":"2016-03-25T14:30:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9295394420623779,"text_excerpt":"Good place for some quick seafood if you're in the Warehouse District/ convention center area. We popped in before heading out for the evening because I saw raves about the BBQ boiled shrimp and they were right! I don't know if I'd call the flavoring BBQ exactly but it was excellent, esp soaked in the bread that came with it. Paired it with a couple bowls of $7 seafood gumbo and we were ready to roll without spending a ton. Place is small, with only 5-6 tables and some bar stools. Clean with a big window into the kitchen. Definitely would go back!"},{"business_id":"g7uv5VJ645cCh0ofch6KTQ","review_id":"Wtf3Vzx3My1vHM3hakhafA","date":"2019-07-07T12:18:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9197461605072021,"text_excerpt":"Woah! Portion sizes! Definitely get bang for your buck here! And the food is quite delicious. I visited a lot of restaurants this past trip to New Orleans, this was only one of two that I visited a second time. The service here is great! No wait time either trip I was in, once for lunch and another time for dinner. So I can's say how busy or not this place gets. Overall I'm very happy with my time spent here and suggest that you go and check it out. The BBQ shrimp is pretty amazing and the po' boys area great too!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"g7uv5VJ645cCh0ofch6KTQ","photo_id":"JZLLiVl95bhMkqcuOojN3Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JZLLiVl95bhMkqcuOojN3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9114499092102051},{"business_id":"g7uv5VJ645cCh0ofch6KTQ","photo_id":"Fuavws-gCdPzEqNIlUpVag","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Fuavws-gCdPzEqNIlUpVag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8278070688247681},{"business_id":"g7uv5VJ645cCh0ofch6KTQ","photo_id":"vpYoCVuW6pBJaVTVU7AAew","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vpYoCVuW6pBJaVTVU7AAew.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8105198740959167}]},"notebook_case":null}
